rooms_desc ({"A big central room. There are cables leading to the room to the north.You can hear the noices of computers for north.To the east you see another room.","This is the computer room. There are many high tech computers.You see a small hexium, a PowerPC620, a Vax 9500, a Sun and a C90 !There is a central terminal sorrounded by giant speakers, two sub bases and a huge monitor.You can SMELL the computers !","This room is used to leave thing temporarely! Of course not valuable things.For those there is another room.","You are in a nice living-room. The room is full of plants what gives the sensation of a jungle.In a corner there is a nice and big parrot watching you. There are severalchairs and a big table full of fruits. You can feel the calmness of thisplace.","This is a small sanctuary. There is a crucifix of Csakany on the wall.He hangs on his own tie !!!You feel a big relief as you see the blood slowly dropping from the corpse !","You enter in a room that is more or less circle shaped. There is some kindof control panel near wall. You can see many lights shimmering on it.On the far side there is some kind of platform with eight circles with abouttwo feet of diameter and a nineth one much bigger in the center. With a sudden idea you check the control panel again and you see that there arethree big, labeled buttons on it among the others. You can read 'shop','guild' and 'church' on them. But where is Geordi ?","You find yourself in a big treasury. It's full of gold, diamonds and everything valuable you can only imagine. In the center you can see a sixfeet tall mountain of gold coins with a nice golden crown.A so immense sight of treasures makes you think about the value of everything.Although you could use it you realize that money it's not eveything and youdon't even want to touch anything. You feel that you have made an importantstep ahead in your short life. ","This is the bedroom. It's a comfortable warm room with a nice bigbed. On the bed there is .... Ooopss ...    ( ! )          `            O    ( ? )         /\\__O '           > > \\Hm.... maybe you'd better leave them alone !","You entered in the dungeon. It is a small one but fully furnished with everything a dungeon should have. You can see chains hanging on the wall.There are several strange objects you don't even dare to think what theyare for. There are a couple of whips hanging on a hook. You also see abig chest in the corner with something like a mouth peg hanging out.You can smell strange things in the air and you know that this place is oftent used. You feel the urge to leave or you might be kept here for alonger period you originaly wanted to.","This is an ancient weapon store. It is praticaly a big circle with a diameter of 6 meters. There are several swords on the wall with some shields among them. There are all kinds of them from ancient Egypt,samurai swords from Japan and China , from medieval Europe.There are some spanish and french swords from the eighteenth century.You see some shorter weapons you've never seen before.In the front wall there is only one weapon . It's a very old samuraisword with ivory figures on it. You can feel a strange force fieldaround it that keeps you away from it. Somehow you know that it wouldn'tbe a good idea to touch it.",})
